    "intro_html":  "Smoked sausage, cabbage and apple is one of those old pairings that works because the sweet and the salty need each other. A splash of cider vinegar and a spoon of dijon keep it from tipping into dessert territory. Served over rice it lands at 26 grams of protein for about $3.44 a serving (at everyday cost), and apples are one of the cheapest fruits on the board most of the year.",
